# Invoice Client View — main page, not Preview

In CCH Studio, **"Preview"** usually means the **client PDF popup** (`previewDocument`). Client-facing invoice UX must live on the **main invoice page**, not only Preview.

## Correct surface

| Control | Where | Purpose |
|---------|-------|---------|
| **Client View** | Main invoice page (default for design-services) | Value-forward client layout |
| **Manage** | Toggle on main page | Working table + summary/outcomes editor |
| **Print / PDF** | Main page button | Prints Client View |
| Preview popup | Secondary | Legacy PDF preview — do **not** put redesign here alone |

## Key files

- `platform/cch-invoice-redesign.js` — `cchDocSetViewMode`, Client View renderer, Print, AI draft editor
- `platform/cch-proposals-invoices-fix.js` — `renderDocViewPage` wraps design-services invoices
- Spec: `Docs/INVOICE_REDESIGN_V2_SPEC_CW_Jun28_v2.0.md`
- Handoff: `Docs/HANDOFF_TO_CURSOR1_invoice-redesign_CW_Jun28.md`

## Isolation

Respect `cch-doc-isolation.js`: `clientSummary`, `clientOutcomes`, and invoice line fields are **doc-local**. No back-sync to Product Library or room-board clips on save.

## AI summary function

`draftInvoiceSummary` (Gen2 callable in `functions/aiInvoiceSummary.js`) — deploy separately to staging; requires `ANTHROPIC_API_KEY` secret on that project.

## Verify on staging

Open a **design-services** invoice on staging → Client View default → Manage toggle → Show date & hours → Print / PDF. Use a staging-native invoice (prod docs may not exist on staging).
